    "rating": 4.3,
    "reference": "ChIJCzSgIko1yUwRuJgD7iSXgIY",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Brinda B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101405938233779098648/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqmcwnwbAdHlbd8WG-sZttByrTYuOa3J6v-pcMsmQdH5fgPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The owner and staff here are fantastic. Their care for the horses is above and beyond. I just want to first thank you and your family (and your staff) for the excellent care that everyone provided for our horses. By far the best care and really enjoyed the welcoming ambiance from you all.",
        "time": 1762183359,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Amazing experience for toddlers. Very well organized. Love the 30 min package to explore and see if you're toddler will be comfortable around horses. They get the kids to groom, comb and feed (treats) the horse get them ready for the ride and teach them How to ride the horse. The parent can be walking beside the child if not sure about balance. The people working the stable are very friendly and good with kids. Definitely making this a monthly thing for my child.",
        "time": 1717873219,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "elisabeth seguin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104299969979766031301/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUipED-VsGoGhAjuBkB6fc9yFNFQ9_t4FVEQXf0c74DhPGsCwM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We had family visiting from out of town with kids aged 5,6 and 9 and we spent an hour at this stable. The kids got to meet many horses, feed them treats, brush and clean and walk meatball  (a miniature horse) and had such an amazing visit! The stables owner Vicky was so inviting and accommodating to us! What an unforgettable experience. I would highly recommend this as a fun family outing with kids!",
        "time": 1721594600,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brett Lukasik",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118278771466980968761/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-0ZH-rFzhnKW9V4pPB8k-CrOIuJJ6EMZlHdcxPXAEKbq09zaK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Our 10-year-old daughters loved this camp!  Most importantly, the kids learned how to care for the horses, not just ride them.   Don't be surprised when your kids are shoveling hay and prepping the horses.  They will ride at least once a day as well as do other activities.  My kids did not mind the work and felt they were better connected to the horses by the end of the week than at their previous ecurie.  This camp builds invaluable work ethics that will stay with your kids for a lifetime. Very friendly instructors and a friendly small group of 5-6 kids for this one-week camp.",
        "time": 1722455336,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M.A. Bell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109864517049281105294/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpWD3XD9L8GxL5rRBT57Xji9qvJjijqN94_1Z4WT-ZQ5FiD3vp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My horse is so happy at Colibri! His special diet is accommodated, he gets all the hay he can eat 24/7, and he loves being turned out with his pasture buddies.\nThe facilities are wonderful. The big stalls have rubber mats and are cleaned daily, with hemp bedding that is dust-free. There's a heated tack and feed room, indoor arena, round pen, and acres and acres of trails right on the property!\nEven though I can't get there every day, I rest easy knowing he is in great hands. I highly recommend\nL'Écurie Colibri!!",
        "time": 1722537305,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
